This module is derived from the terminal-emulator library of Termux
(https://github.com/termux/termux-app, version 0.118.3), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and itself derives from Jack Palevich's Android Terminal Emulator.

Changes made for Vibez:
- TerminalSession runs on a pluggable TerminalBackend (local pseudo-terminal or SSH channel)
  instead of being tied to a local process.
- Added TerminalBackend and LocalProcessBackend.
- The native pseudo-terminal code (src/main/cpp/pty.c) is a new implementation built for
  16 KB page size devices.
